er to look into these alleged miracles and the \"Aurora Society\" conducting them. As the waters lap and crash all around the vessel, mysterious individuals gather under the banner of the \"Phoenix.\" Ciel and Sebastian may be one step closer to the truth, but have they sealed their fates by conducting an investigation on what could easily become a floating coffin...?","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8}],"value":8,"age":"pg-13"},"current_season_id":10088,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}